{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1321417001:0":{"text":"피터, 걱정하지 마요. 발자국만 따라가면 형을 찾을 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"彼得，别担心，跟着脚印一直走就能找到你哥哥了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E5C053D6FC4AC93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1321417002:0":{"text":"알아요, 형은 분명 괜찮을 거예요! 형은 한때 공국 근위대의 순찰 대장이었으니까요!","source_cn":"我知道，哥哥他一定会没事的！他以前可是公国卫队的巡逻队长呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6A2E5561042D9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321417003:0":{"text":"그때 그 사고만 아니었어도... 형은 쫓겨나지 않고, 사람들이 형을 겁쟁이라 부르지도 않았을 거예요!","source_cn":"如果不是那次意外……他才不会被开除呢，更不会被大家说是懦夫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1799816EE648BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321417004:0":{"text":"그래도 전 형을 믿어요! 형이 뭘 하든, 분명 이유가 있을 거예요!","source_cn":"反正我相信他！无论我哥哥做什么，都肯定是有原因的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD97E94EDCFBB18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"피터","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}